share_fuse_fallback.description:
Share **{share_name}** is set to live only on pool **{pool}**, but Unraid is serving it through the slower FUSE user share layer (`/mnt/user`) instead of exclusive access, because a `{share_name}` folder also exists on: **{locations}**.

**To fix:**
1. Check the `{share_name}` folder on {locations} (it may hold data) and move its contents to pool {pool}
2. Remove the folder from {locations}
3. Stop and start the array so Unraid switches the share back to exclusive access

This issue clears automatically once the share is exclusive again.
